{$protagName}: (<i>Well, today wasn’t so bad after all.</i>)
{$protagName}: (<i>I wonder who else is going to stop by the memory tree.</i>)
{$protagName}: (<i>If things keep going like this, then this week should just fly by, and I’ll meet some nice people along the way.</i>)
